artifacts:
  - $route/2.3.scenario.enumeration.blend.yield.md

reviews:
  self:
    - slug: has-complete-union
      say: |
        is every scenario from BOTH streams in the blend? a scenario dropped in
        the merge is a scenario the whole route can never charge or eliminate.
    - slug: has-provenance-tags
      say: |
        is each scenario tagged imagination-only / literature-only / both? the
        imagination-only branches must be flagged as unattested (they survive on
        severity and lean on the assay).
